{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1qjSJwNB4SYT41TRos","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Fix first: Step 3, the login gate on the emailed link.** Someone who forgot their password can't log in, so this is a dead end. It's the most likely reason the flow drives calls. I'm assuming it's a real gate and not a misdescription, so confirm that in the first day.\n\n**Sprint plan, in order:**\n\n1. **Remove the login requirement from the reset page.** Use a single-use, short-lived, signed token as proof of identity. Keep the reset on the mobile web page for now. Bring in your security team early, because this is a bank. Also consider re-authenticating at the end of a reset (for example with a step-up check) and sending a \"your password changed\" notice.\n2. **Show the password rules up front, with live checks as the user types, and specific errors.** For example, say \"can't match your last 5 passwords\" instead of \"does not meet requirements\". This is cheap, probably a few days, and it likely causes repeat failures once Step 3 is fixed.\n3. **Move \"Forgot password\" above the fold.** This is a small layout change that can ship alongside the others.\n\n**Leave alone or defer:**\n- **Step 2's wording is correct.** It stops attackers from finding out which emails have accounts. You could add \"check spam\" and a \"resend\" option, but don't change the core message.\n- **Opening the link in the app (universal links or app links) is the right long-term fix,** but it needs app-store releases and domain configuration. That's likely more than one sprint on top of the rest, so schedule it next.\n\n**Caveat:** I don't have funnel data. Before the sprint, ask support to tag reset calls by step, and instrument completion at each step. Use those numbers to check the order and to measure the result."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3447,"cache_read_input_tokens":5101,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3447},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"337d11b1-6aef-4ab5-ad8e-2947887de703","uuid":"c362126f-b899-46dc-86e5-5d54776f1d97","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:17:29.756Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1qjCRbkSeq8SxDaEcj"}
